<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.69 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 6.69 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 6.69 percent in the week ending November 23 from 6.61 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Nov 23, 1996  Nov 16, 1996  Nov 25, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +6.69	   +6.61	   +7.75</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  319.0	   319.4	   299.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended November 25, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
